==Translingual==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|mul}} {{term|εὔχαρις||gracious|sc=polytonic|tr=eukharis|lang=grc}}, from {{term|εὖ||well, good|tr=eu|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}} + {{term|χάρις||grace|tr=kharis|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}.

===Proper noun===
{{infl|mul|proper noun}}

# a [[taxonomic]] [[genus]], within [[family]] [[Amaryllidaceae]] - several [[bulbous]] [[plant]]s from [[Central America|Central]] and [[South America]]

